# Optional: Add your GitHub Personal Access Token to increase API rate limits
# Without a token, GitHub limits unauthenticated requests to 60/hour
# With a token, the limit increases to 5000/hour
#
# How to generate: GitHub Settings > Developer Settings > Personal Access Tokens > Tokens (classic)
# Required scopes: public_repo, read:user
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here
